n resources and persisted results per the\n52\t  canonical result schema.\n53\t- Side-by-side comparison view of evaluation results for two model versions.\n54\t- Linkage from an evaluation result to the evaluated model's Model Registry\n55\t  version.\n56\t\n57\t## Acceptance Criteria\n58\t\n59\t- Users can see evaluation runs, their status, and per-benchmark scores in\n60\t  the Dashboard.\n61\t- Users can compare two model versions' evaluation results side by side.\n62\t- The integration follows existing Dashboard patterns: reads/writes\n63\t  Kubernetes CRs, no private component APIs, per-component feature flag via\n64\t  OdhDashboardConfig.\n65\t- The evaluation resource shapes / API the views are built against are\n66\t  available and documented (acceptance gate — the views target whichever\n67\t  execution implementation the execution-engine investigation selected).\n68\t\n69\t## HLR Traceability\n70\t\n71\tHLR-5 (Dashboard shows evaluation runs, status, per-benchmark scores, and\n72\tside-by-side comparison of two model versions).\n73\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-96875f4f06a4778a","agent_id":"a1fc1168939a548f8","session_id":"959af684-2b7d-43b9-bdc0-4a564a1f5aaf","uuid":"4bdac230-455f-4127-894f-baf39b820c58","timestamp":"2026-10-21T23:40:32.834Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a7f779e0d685095a","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9002 decomposition"}
