tained for the suites marked redistributable, or\n51\t  the conditionality is explicitly recorded.\n52\t- The delivery mechanism per suite is documented for the execution\n53\t  implementation to build against.\n54\t\n55\t## HLR Traceability\n56\t\n57\tGates the out-of-the-box delivery of HLR-2 (standard benchmark suites\n58\tavailable out of the box); also informs the disconnected-environment guidance\n59\tin the documentation for HLR-9.\n60\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b75db364a0cdb1b7","agent_id":"ac52824ac12a50737","session_id":"959af684-2b7d-43b9-bdc0-4a564a1f5aaf","uuid":"0f882de6-b508-42a9-8d6f-5275bd982932","timestamp":"2026-10-21T23:55:33.458Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-bbaa9b791a7de15c","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9002 again"}
