int or Llama Stack distribution)\n54\t  against a selected benchmark suite, and reading persisted results.\n55\t- Viewing evaluation runs, status, per-benchmark scores, and model version\n56\t  comparisons in the Dashboard.\n57\t- Embedding evaluations as pipeline steps and gating promotion flows on\n58\t  scores.\n59\t- Custom evaluation task authoring guide: defining own datasets and metrics\n60\t  and running them through the same flow.\n61\t- Disconnected-environment guidance reflecting the benchmark licensing\n62\t  decisions: which suites ship in-product and which the customer must fetch.\n63\t\n64\t## Acceptance Criteria\n65\t\n66\t- Documentation covers the full workflow from launching an evaluation to\n67\t  persisted and compared results, including custom task authoring.\n68\t- Content is technically reviewed against the implemented evaluation\n69\t  capability (all implementation work complete before review).\n70\t- Disconnected-environment guidance is accurate per the benchmark licensing\n71\t  allowlist.\n72\t\n73\t## HLR Traceability\n74\t\n75\tHLR-9 (product documentation covers the evaluation workflow end to end,\n76\tincluding custom task authoring).\n77\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-852293eafcbabda8","agent_id":"ad0d45a1d3a0e9829","session_id":"959af684-2b7d-43b9-bdc0-4a564a1f5aaf","uuid":"ec403127-2e81-4cae-9173-42ab56ed3731","timestamp":"2026-10-22T00:03:44.484Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9591a27572e547a0","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Second re-revise RHAISTRAT-9002"}
